<DocsLayout title="Rule Engine" description="RelayCore interception rule engine">
  <h1>Rule Engine</h1>

  <p>The rule engine evaluates flows against a pipeline of match + action rules.</p>

  <h2>Filter Examples</h2>

  <pre><code>method: GET
host: api.example.com
status: 200</code></pre>

  <h2>Action Types</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>log - Log the flow</li>
    <li>intercept - Pause for inspection</li>
    <li>mock - Return mock response</li>
    <li>redirect - Redirect to URL</li>
    <li>block - Block the request</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Managing Rules</h2>
  <pre><code>relay-core-cli rules import rules.yaml
relay-core-cli rules export</code></pre>
</DocsLayout>